      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} Yes! \n\n1. Created these instances\n\n2. See world page, and find created instance\n\n3. Select it, drop portal\n\n4. See portal through my sub account\n\nI can choose portal lock status when create it, and comfirmed it works.\n\nAlso, for Group+ instance, I comfirmed that I have enough permission.\n\nNote that Group+ portal sometimes dropped by event staff or someone, so unlocked portal for existing instance is really needed.\n\n(And I recognized this problem because I heard about this from a friend who is an event staff member who encountered this exact case.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
