  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Drop portal for existing instance will make the lock state of the portal as follows.\n\n- Group+ portal -> Locked\n\n- Friends+ portal -> Unlocked\n\n- Friends portal -> Unlocked\n\nFor these instance types, we can change the lock state when we create a new instance.\n\nHowever, the above behavior is forced and we cannot change.\n\nThe lock state should be changeable even when we drop portal for an existing instance.",
